model ania
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-25
  start 2024-01-01
  end 2024-12-31
  note "PTY-05, household A (Ania): the gift stated as an outside fact, a row of A's own statement, received from Halina, whom A doesn't keep (an outside place)."

source a_household "Household A's statement: received 5 000.00 from Halina (made up)"

unit DUK: currency minor 0.01

place acc_ania: accounts DUK lives 2024-01-01..

place halina: outside lives 2024-01-01..

input a_stmt: observed

ask q_ania: flows(acc_ania, 2024)

version a_statement
  cite a_household
  governs 2024-05
  known 2024-05-02
  covers acc_ania
  a_stmt[a_g1] = (on: 2024-05-02, kind: transfers, leg cash from halina to acc_ania amount 5000.00 DUK) "A-G1: received from Halina"
